# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore — tree-methanogens
# ==============================================================================
# Strategy: Track code, figures, and directory structure.
# Data file *contents* are archived on Zenodo; only .gitkeep files are tracked
# to preserve the directory layout for reproducibility.
# ==============================================================================

# --- R project files ---
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store

# --- Claude Code ---
.claude/

# --- Manuscript files (not for public repos) ---
manuscript/
*.docx
*.tex
REVISED_*.md
REFERENCE_*.md
supporting_information.md
references.bib
doi_list.txt
outputs/figure_captions.md
# Revision prose/notes (manuscript-adjacent; not for public repo)
code/revision/notes/

# --- Data (all archived on Zenodo; git tracks ONLY the folder structure) ---
# Every data file lives in the Zenodo archive and drops into data/ locally.
# Git keeps only .gitkeep so the directory layout (and all paths) are pre-wired.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/.gitkeep

# --- Outputs (regenerable via the pipeline; git tracks ONLY the folder structure
#     and the assembled numbered manuscript figure set) ---
outputs/**
!outputs/**/
!outputs/**/.gitkeep
# NOTHING under outputs/ is tracked -- only the folder skeleton, exactly as for
# data/. The assembled manuscript figure set used to be the one exception
# (!outputs/revision/figures/**), kept so a reader got the figures from a clone.
# It is no longer needed: code/make_figures.R regenerates the whole numbered set
# end to end (generators -> assembler) from the Zenodo data drop-in, so the
# figures are reproducible rather than stored.
#
# NOTE for submission: figures therefore live only on disk after a local run.
# The Zenodo archive holds data/, not outputs/, so journal figure files come from
# outputs/figures/{main,SI}/ after running make_figures.R -- not from the repo.

# --- Deprecated directory (old code/data, not tracked) ---
deprecated/

# --- Temporary/auto-generated files ---
Rplots.pdf
*.Rplots.pdf

# goFlux import intermediates (regenerable; see rescue workflow)
RData/
